{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
"ASK SAGA" GRID TILE (main-collection block type "promotion_saga")
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

One card slot in the product grid: Saga's avatar, a heading, one line and a button that opens the Saga chat dialog
(snippets/saga-chat.liquid). Renders nothing while Saga is off in theme settings, so the grid
never shows a dead tile. Hidden for signed-in customers who already own a player (they're choosing books, not a pack).

Supported variables: block, section
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if settings.saga_enabled -%}
  {%- capture owns_player -%}{%- render 'customer-owns-player' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- if owns_player == blank or block.settings.show_to_owners -%}
    {%- assign avatar = block.settings.image -%}
    <div id="block-{{ section.id }}-{{ block.id }}" class="saga-tile" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
      <button type="button" class="saga-tile__button" data-saga-avatar-hover data-saga-open="collection_tile" data-saga-collection="{{ collection.handle }}" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="saga-chat">
        <span class="saga-tile__avatar-wrap">
          {%- if avatar != blank -%}
            {{- avatar | image_url: width: 320 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '160,240,320', sizes: '160px', class: 'saga-tile__avatar', alt: '' -}}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- render 'saga-avatar', id: block.id, class: 'saga-tile__avatar', size: 160 -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        </span>
        {%- if block.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}<span class="saga-tile__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        <span class="saga-tile__title">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</span>
        {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}<span class="saga-tile__text">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        <span class="series-button saga-tile__cta" aria-hidden="true">{{ block.settings.button_label | default: 'Help me choose' | escape }}</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
